\subsection{\code{BaseRPairsLayerProcessor$panel_layer()}}{
  One panel's points, axes and selector

A pair with a missing coordinate is dropped rather than announced.
Measured, \code{pairs()} hands its panel the raw columns including \code{NA},
and \code{points()} then draws nothing for that pair -- so announcing it
would offer a sample the chart does not draw (#170).
